  <entry>
    <title>拼团项目的库表设计</title>
    <link href="/2026/03/17/%E6%8B%BC%E5%9B%A2%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%93%E8%A1%A8%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/"/>
    <url>/2026/03/17/%E6%8B%BC%E5%9B%A2%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%93%E8%A1%A8%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="拼团项目的库表设计"><a href="#拼团项目的库表设计" class="headerlink" title="拼团项目的库表设计"></a>拼团项目的库表设计</h3><h4 id="建表需求"><a href="#建表需求" class="headerlink" title="建表需求"></a>建表需求</h4><ul><li>对于运营商来说,我们需要了解到拼团商品的来源,渠道和优惠政策,同时需要进行回调通知第三方(也就是调用我们拼团服务的厂商),由此可以想到这几张表: 1.group_buy_activity(记录团购活动) 2.group_buy_discount(记录优惠政策) 3.notify_task(回调任务) 4.sc_sku_activity(商品参与活动信息) 5.sku(商品信息)</li><li>对于用户来说,我们需要对于每个用户团进行记录,同时也要对每个用户的购买进行记录,所以可以创建一下几张表: 1.group_buy_order(团订单信息) 2.group_buy_order_list(用户订单信息)</li><li>对于服务盈利角度来说,我们也需要对每个用户通过不同标签来区分,以区分拼团的折扣力度和可参与性,这里可以拆分成这几张表: 1.crowd_tags(人群标签) 2.crowd_tags_detail(人群标签明细) 3.crowd_tags_job(标签任务)</li></ul><h4 id="字段信息"><a href="#字段信息" class="headerlink" title="字段信息"></a>字段信息</h4><ul><li><p>crowd_tags(标签定义):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span> 主键id(自增)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_id:</span> 标签唯一标识<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_name:</span> 标签名称<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_desc:</span> 标签描述<br><span class="hljs-symbol">statistics:</span> 当前标签下的统计人数<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span> 创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span> 更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>crowd_tags_detail(标签明细):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span> 主键id(自增)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_id:</span> 标签id<br><span class="hljs-symbol">user_id:</span> 用户id<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span> 创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span> 更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>crowd_tags_job(标签计算工作):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span> 主键id(自增)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_id:</span> 标签id<br><span class="hljs-symbol">batch_id:</span> 批次id(表示这次任务执行的唯一id)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_type:</span> 标签类型(更具购买次数划分或者消费金额划分)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_rule:</span> 标签规则值(eg: 消费&gt;<span class="hljs-number">1</span>w)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">stat_start_time:</span>统计开始时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">stat_end_time:</span>统计结束时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">status:</span>状态(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>初始、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>计划（进入执行阶段）、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>重置、<span class="hljs-number">3</span>完成)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span> 创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span> 更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>group_buy_activity(拼团活动信息):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span> 自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_id:</span>活动ID(业务唯一)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_name:</span>活动名称<br><span class="hljs-symbol">discount_id:</span>使用的优惠ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">group_type:</span>拼团方式(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>自动成团、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>达标成团)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">take_limit_count:</span>每人最多参与次数<br><span class="hljs-symbol">target:</span>成团人数(例如<span class="hljs-number">3</span>人)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">valid_time:</span>拼团有效时长(分钟)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">status:</span>活动状态(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>创建、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>生效、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>过期、<span class="hljs-number">3</span>废弃)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">start_time:</span>活动开始时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">end_time:</span>活动结束时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_id:</span>限制人群标签<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_scope:</span>标签作用范围(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>可见、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>参与)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>group_buy_discount(优惠规则):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">discount_id:</span>折扣ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">discount_name:</span>折扣名称<br><span class="hljs-symbol">discount_desc:</span>描述<br><span class="hljs-symbol">discount_type:</span>类型(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>基础、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>标签专属)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">market_plan:</span>优惠类型(ZJ 直减<span class="hljs-comment">;MJ 满减;ZK 折扣;N N元购)</span><br><span class="hljs-symbol">market_expr:</span>优惠表达式（如 <span class="hljs-number">100</span>,<span class="hljs-number">10</span> 或 <span class="hljs-number">0.8</span>）<br><span class="hljs-symbol">tag_id:</span>指定人群标签<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>group_buy_order(拼团的团)</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">team_id:</span>拼团ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_id:</span>活动ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">source:</span>渠道<br><span class="hljs-symbol">channel:</span>来源<br><span class="hljs-symbol">original_price:</span>原价<br><span class="hljs-symbol">deduction_price:</span>优惠金额<br><span class="hljs-symbol">pay_price:</span>实际支付<br><span class="hljs-symbol">target_count:</span>成团目标人数<br><span class="hljs-symbol">complete_count:</span>已完成人数<br><span class="hljs-symbol">lock_count:</span>锁定人数（已下单未支付）<br><span class="hljs-symbol">status:</span>状态（<span class="hljs-number">0</span>拼团中、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>成功、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>失败）<br><span class="hljs-symbol">valid_start_time:</span>拼团开始时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">valid_end_time:</span>拼团结束时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">notify_url:</span>成团回调地址<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>group_by_order_list(用户订单):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">user_id:</span>用户ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">team_id:</span>拼团ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">order_id:</span>订单号<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_id:</span>活动ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">start_time:</span>活动开始时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">end_time:</span>活动结束时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">goods_id:</span>商品ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">source:</span>渠道<br><span class="hljs-symbol">channel:</span>来源<br><span class="hljs-symbol">original_price:</span>原价<br><span class="hljs-symbol">deduction_price:</span>优惠金额<br><span class="hljs-symbol">status:</span>状态(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>锁定、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>完成、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>退款)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">out_trade_no:</span>外部支付单号（幂等用）<br><span class="hljs-symbol">out_trade_time:</span>支付时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">biz_id:</span>业务唯一ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>notify_task(回调任务):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_id:</span>活动ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">team_id:</span>拼团ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">notify_url:</span>回调地址<br><span class="hljs-symbol">notify_count:</span>已通知次数<br><span class="hljs-symbol">notify_status:</span>状态(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>初始、<span class="hljs-number">1</span>成功、<span class="hljs-number">2</span>重试、<span class="hljs-number">3</span>失败)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">parameter_json:</span>回调参数(JSON字符串)<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>sku(商品信息):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">source:</span>渠道<br><span class="hljs-symbol">channel:</span>来源<br><span class="hljs-symbol">goods_id:</span>商品ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">goods_name:</span>商品名称<br><span class="hljs-symbol">original_price:</span>商品原价<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>sc_sku_activity(商品-活动关联表):</p><figure class="highlight avrasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs avrasm"><span class="hljs-symbol">id:</span>自增ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">source:</span>渠道<br><span class="hljs-symbol">channel:</span>来源<br><span class="hljs-symbol">activity_id:</span>活动ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">goods_id:</span>商品ID<br><span class="hljs-symbol">create_time:</span>创建时间<br><span class="hljs-symbol">update_time:</span>更新时间<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h3 id="理解问题"><a href="#理解问题" class="headerlink" title="理解问题"></a>理解问题</h3><h4 id="初始状态"><a href="#初始状态" class="headerlink" title="初始状态:"></a>初始状态:</h4><p>对于数据库表的自增不了解,认为业务拥有一个自增id就可以了,即使分库分表也不会重复,认为没有必要专门搞一个业务唯一id</p><h4 id="解释"><a href="#解释" class="headerlink" title="解释"></a>解释</h4><p>数据库自增是表级的,每个表会维护自己的自增计数器,也就是说只要分库分表就一定造成自增id的重复,所以需要一个业务id来保证全局的唯一性</p>]]></content>
    
    
